    "description": "The Unfreeze Banking Accounts API allows financial institutions to swiftly reinstate access to accounts that have been frozen. This endpoint enables the modification of account status from frozen to active, ensuring customers regain immediate access to their funds. Typical consumers of this API include bank personnel and financial transaction systems that require seamless account management. Use cases involve customer service operations and automated processes responding to account status changes, enhancing customer satisfaction and operational efficiency.",
